  "A single number will be treated as a loop count, a single string will be treated as an array of characters, and other non-array values will be converted to arrays. The loop node ends when the loop count is reached, or when the array loop is completed. You can also add condition nodes to the loop to terminate it.": "單一數字值將被視為循環次數，單一字符串值將被視為字符數組，其他非數組值將被轉換為數組。達到循環次數，或者將數組循環完成後，循環節點結束。你也可以在循環中添加條件節點，以終止循環。",
