  "By using a loop node, you can perform the same operation on multiple sets of data. The source of these sets can be either multiple records from a query node or multiple associated records of a single record. Loop node can also be used for iterating a certain number of times or for looping through each character in a string. However, excessive looping may cause performance issues, so use with caution.": "使用循環節點可以對多條資料進行同樣的操作，多條資料的來源可以是查詢節點的多條結果，或者一條資料的多條關係資料。也可以用於一定次數的循環，或者對字符串中每一個字符的循環處理。循環次數過高可能引起性能問題，請謹慎使用。",
